<title>HONG KONG: Sino Land 1995/96 net HK$1.15 bln.</title>
<headline>Sino Land 1995/96 net HK$1.15 bln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   44.7     vs 120.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    12.0     vs 8.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs 1,919.08 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    1,149.87 vs 2,865.80</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,561.04 vs 1,735.13</p>
<p>    Company name		 Sino Land Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  November 18-22</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   December 20</p>
<p>NOTE - Sino Land is a property development and investment company.</p>
<p>Net is after exceptional items of nil vs HK$1.92 billion gain on disposal of the group's hospitality interests after spinning-off the related businesses.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 20 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of eight cents) vs 16 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
